"BQ-e-C1-b8-0":"<svg viewBox=\"-143 -14 560 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lâmpadas fluorescentes com reator de 96 watts em 220 volts e fator de potência 0,5: corrente de 0,873 ampère\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L70 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 93 L70 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(70 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-15 M15 0 H28\"/><circle class=\"s-comp\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"15\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-9 0 q4.5 -9 9 0 t9 0\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"48\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"end\">220 V</text><text class=\"s-fa\" x=\"48\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"end\">I = 0,873 A</text><polygon class=\"s-f-pa\" points=\"70,14 65,26 75,26\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L110 0\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M110 0 L110 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M110 93 L110 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(110 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-20 M20 0 H28\"/><rect class=\"s-comp\" x=\"-20\" y=\"-9\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"132\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"start\">lâmpadas + reator = 96 W</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"132\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\">FP = 0,5 ind.</text><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"110\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"110\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 130 L110 130\"/><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\">I = P/(V·FP) = 96/(220·0,5) ≈ 0,873 A</text></svg>",
"BQ-e-C1-b8-1":"<svg viewBox=\"-106 -14 560 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Luminária de 96 watts com fator de potência 0,5 e capacitor de 6,9 microfarads em paralelo para elevar o fator de potência a 0,92\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L70 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 93 L70 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(70 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-15 M15 0 H28\"/><circle class=\"s-comp\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"15\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-9 0 q4.5 -9 9 0 t9 0\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"48\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"end\">220 V · 60 Hz</text><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L130 0\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"130\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"130\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M130 0 L130 37\"/><g transform=\"translate(130 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-20 M20 0 H28\"/><rect class=\"s-comp\" x=\"-20\" y=\"-9\" width=\"40\" height=\"18\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"152\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"start\">luminária = 96 W</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"152\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\">FP = 0,5 ind.</text><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M130 93 L130 130\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M130 0 L284.8 0\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"284.8\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"284.8\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M284.8 0 L284.8 37\"/><g transform=\"translate(284.8 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-4 M-4 -13 V13 M4 -13 V13 M4 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"306.8\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"start\">C = 6,9 µF</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"306.8\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"start\">Qc ≈ 125 var</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"306.8\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\">FP → 0,92</text><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M284.8 93 L284.8 130\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 130 L284.8 130\"/><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\">C = Qc/(2π·f·V²) = 125,4/(377·220²) ≈ 6,9 µF</text></svg>",
