"BQ-e-I1-y2":"<svg viewBox=\"-73 -46 560 225\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Carga de 6.160 watts em 220 volts: corrente de projeto de 28 ampères, capacidade corrigida de 36 ampères e disjuntor de 32 ampères\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L70 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 93 L70 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(70 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-15 M15 0 H28\"/><circle class=\"s-comp\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"15\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-9 0 q4.5 -9 9 0 t9 0\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"48\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"end\">220 V</text><text class=\"s-fa\" x=\"48\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"end\">I = IB = 28 A</text><polygon class=\"s-f-pa\" points=\"70,14 65,26 75,26\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L120.4 0\"/><g transform=\"translate(148.4 0) rotate(0)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-12 M12 0 H28\"/><rect class=\"s-comp\" x=\"-12\" y=\"-6\" width=\"24\" height=\"12\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-12 0 H12\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"148.4\" y=\"-24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">disjuntor = 32 A</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"148.4\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">28 ≤ 32 ≤ 36</text><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M176.4 0 L222.8 0\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M222.8 0 L222.8 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M222.8 93 L222.8 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(222.8 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-21 L-17 -8 L-9 8 L-1 -8 L7 8 L15 -8 L21 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"244.8\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"start\">carga</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"244.8\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"start\">6.160 W</text><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"222.8\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"222.8\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 130 L222.8 130\"/><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\">Iz = 50·0,80·0,90 = 36 A → IB ≤ In ≤ Iz → disjuntor de 32 A</text></svg>",
"BQ-e-I1-y4":"<svg viewBox=\"-104 -46 560 243\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Esquema TT com 127 volts, resistência de aterramento do neutro de 2,7 ohms e das massas de 10 ohms: falta de 10 ampères, 100 volts nas massas, a corrente retorna pela terra\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L70 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 93 L70 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(70 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-15 M15 0 H28\"/><circle class=\"s-comp\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"15\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-9 0 q4.5 -9 9 0 t9 0\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"48\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"end\">fase–neutro = 127 V</text><text class=\"s-fa\" x=\"48\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"end\">I = 10 A</text><polygon class=\"s-f-pa\" points=\"70,14 65,26 75,26\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L114 0\"/><g transform=\"translate(142 0) rotate(0)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"142\" y=\"-24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">falta = direta</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"142\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">fase → massa</text><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M170 0 L230.2 0\"/><g transform=\"translate(258.2 0) rotate(0)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-21 L-17 -8 L-9 8 L-1 -8 L7 8 L15 -8 L21 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"258.2\" y=\"-24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RA = 10 Ω</text><text class=\"s-fb\" x=\"258.2\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\">U = 100 V</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"258.2\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\">massas → terra</text><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M286.2 0 L326.2 0\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M326.2 0 L326.2 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M326.2 93 L326.2 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(326.2 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-21 L-17 -8 L-9 8 L-1 -8 L7 8 L15 -8 L21 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"348.2\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"start\">RB = 2,7 Ω</text><text class=\"s-fb\" x=\"348.2\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"start\">U = 27 V</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"348.2\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\">terra → fonte</text><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"326.2\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"326.2\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 130 L326.2 130\"/><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\">I = 127/(2,7 + 10) = 10 A · V das massas = 10·10 = 100 V</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\">o disjuntor não atua: o seccionamento exige DR</text></svg>",
"BQ-e-I1-y5":"<svg viewBox=\"-168 -14 560 193\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Esquema TN-S de 127 volts fase-neutro com laço de falta de 0,5 ohm: corrente de falta de 254 ampères\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L70 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 93 L70 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(70 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-15 M15 0 H28\"/><circle class=\"s-comp\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"15\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-9 0 q4.5 -9 9 0 t9 0\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"48\" y=\"61\" text-anchor=\"end\">fase–PE = 127 V</text><text class=\"s-fa\" x=\"48\" y=\"77\" text-anchor=\"end\">I = 254 A</text><polygon class=\"s-f-pa\" points=\"70,14 65,26 75,26\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"70\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 0 L110 0\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M110 0 L110 37\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M110 93 L110 130\"/><g transform=\"translate(110 65) rotate(90)\"><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M-28 0 H-21 L-17 -8 L-9 8 L-1 -8 L7 8 L15 -8 L21 0 H28\"/></g><text class=\"s-ts\" x=\"132\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"start\">laço de falta = 0,5 Ω</text><text class=\"s-fb\" x=\"132\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"start\">U = 127 V</text><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"132\" y=\"85\" text-anchor=\"start\">fase + PE</text><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"110\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3.6\"/><circle class=\"s-f-ink\" cx=\"110\" cy=\"130\" r=\"3.6\"/><path class=\"s-wire s-ink\" d=\"M70 130 L110 130\"/><text class=\"s-tm\" x=\"30\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\">Ifalta = 127/0,5 = 254 A</text></svg>",
